      "id": "kpk1-l21-b2-t01",
      "before": "kpk1-l21-b2-e01",
      "title": {
        "en": "Sto lat!"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "At a birthday or a name day everyone sings *Sto lat*, a hundred years: *sto lat, sto lat, niech żyje, żyje nam*, may he or she live a hundred years among us, and then *jeszcze raz*, once more. Then the guests, *goście*, *składają życzenia*: they give their good wishes. There is a cake with *świeczki* (candles), and often a glass of *szampan*. *Wszystkiego dobrego!* is all the best, a little less festive than *wszystkiego najlepszego!*"
      }
    }
  ],
